{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:12:24.186Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e7c53ce8e537f9c35d21b20d65efcc79ca72e29c7a75d2d65eec8c99fccbc734","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"June Osei-Lark: I've set up a 'Pod end of day' job for weekdays at 17:30 Central. It will post a list of the day's new #strategic-pod messages here. Two caveats. The scheduler isn't active yet because the gateway isn't running, so nothing will post until that's started. That includes today's 17:30 note. Also, the scheduler works in UTC, so I set it to 22:30 UTC, which is 17:30 Central while daylight saving is on. After the clocks change on Nov 1 it will need moving to 23:30 UTC.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:12:28.293Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"32644019eeac0851f64cdc913933137f06288df8a76bc6d320ab515836a28f46","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"June, I've set up a \"Pod end of day\" job for weekdays at 17:30 Central, but it won't post anything yet, including today's note.\n\n- **Scheduler:** The job is saved, but the Hermes gateway isn't running, so nothing will fire until someone starts it. The next run is listed as Mon Oct 26, 22:30 UTC, not today.\n- **Time zone:** The scheduler runs in UTC, so I set it to 22:30 UTC, which is 17:30 Central while daylight saving is on. After the clocks change on Nov 1 it needs moving to 23:30 UTC.\n- **Content:** Each run will read only #strategic-pod and post the day's new messages there.\n\nI posted the same caveats in a reply to your message in the channel."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
